# The root's selected numeric OP follows a prior observable effect. Moving
# an OP child later must select the walker before entering the native body;
# retrying the whole root after a native failure would print ONCE twice.
fn: mark () int
    c.puts: "ONCE"
return: 0

mark()
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 10 != 11; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
